%% draw-visual: -x 3 -y 1 -p 0
graph TD
  S[SHARED + hasHotJournal] --> F[Journal, no RESERVED?]
  F -->|yes| Z[db nPage > 0?]
  F -->|no| N[Normal SHARED read]
  Z -->|yes| B[byte 0 != 0x00?]
  Z -->|no| D0[Delete stale journal]
  B -->|yes| E[EXCLUSIVE + sync jnl]
  B -->|no| C[Ignore cold journal]
  E --> SJ[Named super-jnl gone?]
  SJ -->|no| H[Header >= 1 sector?]
  SJ -->|yes| SK[Skip playback]
  H -->|yes| R[Truncate + replay]
  H -->|no| SK
  R --> END[fsync t.db + end tx]
